Mob concepts by Kevin San Pedro

1. Griefer - Mini monsters with sharp teeth that attack with either biting or a sword. Weakness: Dog
2. Mournstalker - comes out during the night. Can teleport and can be defeated with either a sword or a bow & arrow. Weakness: Heat
3. Screelith - A tall pale entity that attacks you only while you look directly at it. Occasionally screams to let you know its there. Weakness: Sun
4. Gluttony - Round glooby creature that Only attacks while you are low on hunger. Weakness: A full hunger bar.
5. Crawler - Robotic aliens with four robotic legs that attack either during the day or night. Weakness: Water
6. Twilight - Occasionally Spawns from a lightning bolt. A tall slender creature with no face but a splitting mouth. Can be killed with weapons. No weakness.
7. Darkness - A lizard like creature that can shoot out its tounge to either grab or damage the player. If Darkness grabs the player he will have a set number of seconds to free themselves before they are eaten. Can be killed with weapons. Comes out during the night.
8. Mimic - A monster that can shapeshift into animals or other players. Can be detected with either being damaged or by getting wet. Original form looks like a gray tall skinny creature with twisted limbs and small eyes and a mouth with sharp teeth.

Secret Monster:
Sir Gloobledorf - A cute little round bunny that has a 1/1000000 chance of spawning and instantly sends you flying and kills you if you touch it. Super rare mob. Inspired from "someone".
